{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0<strong>Five Heads</strong>, five prisoners sit around a table, each with a card on their forehead\u2014visible to everyone but themselves. In the first two rounds, they must figure out where they rank from lowest to highest, using logic, deduction, and psychology. In the final round, each player takes a leap of faith, guessing their exact card. Every guess is a clue, every mistake a setback\u2014can you crack the code?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Run</strong>\u00a0is a high-stakes gauntlet of logic and teamwork. You and your team of five must survive a series of escalating challenges, ending each level in the correct order to advance. Before moving forward, you\u2019ll vote on a power to aid your deduction and a poison that makes the next level even tougher. With each round growing more intense, will your team adapt, or will the increasing chaos break your streak?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791120?t=1749603749","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791120?t=1749603749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791120/12708a901c5b9e8e3ad2aa8f83c82ba5db3ecc1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749603749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791120/12708a901c5b9e8e3ad2aa8f83c82ba5db3ecc1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749603749","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0<strong>Five Heads</strong>, five prisoners sit around a table, each with a card on their forehead\u2014visible to everyone but themselves. In the first two rounds, they must figure out where they rank from lowest to highest, using logic, deduction, and psychology. In the final round, each player takes a leap of faith, guessing their exact card. Every guess is a clue, every mistake a setback\u2014can you crack the code?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Run</strong>\u00a0is a high-stakes gauntlet of logic and teamwork. You and your team of five must survive a series of escalating challenges, ending each level in the correct order to advance. Before moving forward, you\u2019ll vote on a power to aid your deduction and a poison that makes the next level even tougher. With each round growing more intense, will your team adapt, or will the increasing chaos break your streak?</p>","developers":["Snakefeet Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3370840","name":"Five Heads"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791120/8374059445277513f24026e16d93d4d564c05a47/header.jpg?t=1749603749","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X v11 and newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X v11 and newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155228,"mp4":{"480":"http://vid